Z||000010||Ken Wittlief||05-23-2001||10:33 AM||||putting sugar in the gas tank is an old wives tail - it doenst really do anything to the car at all.<P>  if you want to destroy a car take the air cleaner off and put nuts and washers inside the intake manifold. If you want to do it more subtley, put sand in there instead.<P>  if you put nuts and washers in there, dont stand too close when the car is started. Heads will roll.||||reg||1
Z||000011||Ken Wittlief||05-23-2001||10:35 AM||||dont force them down the intake - out them where they will get sucked in when the engine is reved up - if they fall in too soon they will only block the piston when its starting and the engine wont turn over.<P>  you want them to enter the piston when its turning 4000 rpm||||reg||1
